      "body": "## Summary\nFixes #43189. When `SGLDiffusionGenerator.ensure_executor` rebuilds a dead SGLD worker mid ComfyUI sampler run, the executor's `_sent_conds` still held cond keys from the old worker, so `_mark_and_maybe_drop` dropped `prompt_embeds` on the next step. The new worker's session cache (`_SESSIONS` in `comfyui_mode.py`) starts empty in that fresh process, so nothing restored the embeddings and `verify_input` failed.\n\nFix: `ensure_executor` now calls `executor.begin_sampler_run()` right after a successful rebuild, starting a fresh cache lifetime so the next step resends its conditioning.\n\n## Test plan\n- Added `python/sglang/multimodal_gen/apps/ComfyUI_SGLDiffusion/test/test_worker_rebuild_conditioning.py`, a CPU-only regression test using the real executor bookkeeping, `FluxAdapter`, session cache, and `ComfyUILatentPreparationStage.verify_input`. Only worker liveness and `load_model` are stubbed.\n- Verified the test fails without the fix (conditioning not resent, `verify_input` fails) and passes with it.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #37970405971](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37970405971)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37970405623](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37970405623)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #37970405902](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37970405902)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
